==================================================
1. GAME CONCEPT
==================================================

Create a roguelike stage-based adventure game.

The player is a lost soul possessing a small human-sized doll in a medieval magical world that has been corrupted by souls.

A witch has been reviving lost souls and placing them inside dolls so they can fight their way north toward the Demon Lord responsible for the corruption.

The player is the:

4816th revived soul.

The journey begins at a small hut in the bottom-left corner of the world.

The ultimate objective is to travel north through a dangerous world, unlocking paths and progression items, until the player reaches the Lava Mountains and eventually confronts the final Demon Lord.

The game should initially be designed around approximately 15 stages.

