- Goblin
- Bat
- Snake

Enemies can be:

- melee
- ranged
- fast
- slow
- high health
- low health
- defensive
- specialized

Every enemy should have configurable:

- HP
- damage
- movement speed
- attack range
- attack cooldown
- defense
- elemental resistances
- elemental weaknesses
- EXP reward
- gold drop chance
- gold reward
- rare item drop chance

