Adding a new enemy should primarily require adding configuration/data rather than modifying core systems.

==================================================
15. BOSSES AND MINIBOSSES
==================================================

Bosses and minibosses should inherit from appropriate base enemy classes.

They should support:

- high HP
- unique attacks
- phases
- elemental resistances
- elemental immunity
- special mechanics
- unique rewards
- progression items

IMPORTANT:

Boss behavior MUST use a finite state machine.

Create:

BossStateMachine

with states such as:

IDLE
CHASE
ATTACK
SPECIAL_ATTACK
PHASE_TRANSITION
STUNNED
DEAD

The architecture should support:

enter()
update(deltaTime)
exit()

for each state.

Bosses should be able to transition between states based on:

- player distance
- health percentage
- cooldowns
- phase
- timers
- external events

Do not implement every boss now.

Create one simple placeholder boss demonstrating the FSM architecture.

